26,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6Y8Bpi","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected. Code looks good to me.\r\n\r\n**Testing project:** [test_class_names.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18497508/test_class_names.zip)\r\nThis project includes a `generate.sh` script that can be used to create projects with lots of `class_name`s with custom icons.[^1]\r\n\r\n[^1]: Same project without the pregenerated classes in case you have trouble extracting it: [test_class_names.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18497515/test_class_names.zip)\r\n\r\n<details open>\r\n\r\n<summary>PC specifications</summary>\r\n\r\n- **CPU:** Intel Core i9-13900K\r\n- **GPU:** NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4090\r\n- **RAM:** 64 GB (2×32 GB DDR5-5800 C30)\r\n- **SSD:** Solidigm P44 Pro 2 TB\r\n- **OS:** Linux (Fedora 41)\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nUsing an optimized (LTO) editor build.\r\n\r\nIn a project with 10,000 named classes that have their own icon each, this is the delay before the Create New Node dialog shows up after clicking the but